      "value": "There are zero plans to forcibly deprecate software like \"Playspace Mover\". Even if we did want to, it'd be quite difficult. \n\nAlthough we don't support this functionality, it is unlikely that support for it would break. That being said, if functionality degrades or is removed, it would be the result of changes to the \"Playspace Mover\" software.",
